    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong, cohesive dark technical aesthetic across all viewports: decisive headline hierarchy, restrained cyan/green/yellow accents, consistent mono labels, crisp borders, and clear BLOCK→ALLOW storytelling. Desktop composition is especially polished. Tablet and mobile remain coherent, but become extremely tall; repeated precedent rows feel mechanically spacious, tiny uppercase metadata strains readability, and the mobile header visibly truncates “LIVE WI,” weakening finish.",
